# Speeds up `docker build` context loading for tools (e.g. moria) that COPY
# this checkout wholesale. Everything here is either reinstalled/rebuilt
# fresh inside the image (node_modules, dist) or never needed there (.git,
# logs, coverage). Safe to delete; purely a build-context optimization,
# except packages/ai/src/providers/data/ below — that one also avoids an
# EXDEV crash in hydrate-model-data.ts (renaming a COPY'd-in host copy of
# that gitignored dir hits a Docker Desktop containerd-snapshotter overlayfs
# bug on cross-layer renames).
.git/
node_modules/
packages/*/node_modules/
dist/
packages/*/dist/
packages/*/dist-chrome/
packages/*/dist-firefox/
.artifacts/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
packages/ai/src/providers/data/
